{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch-sonnet5/runs/eval-INC-219-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "# harbor-dispatch\n\nBerth planning, cargo manifests and arrival estimates for the terminal operations team.\n\nThe code is TypeScript and runs directly on Node 26; there is no build step and there are no\nruntime dependencies. Port and vessel reference data live under `registry/`. Incidents are\ntracked in the ops queue.\n---OPS---\nincidents.pack\n---PKG---\n{\n  \"name\": \"harbor-dispatch\",\n  \"version\": \"3.4.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"description\": \"Berth planning, cargo manifests and arrival estimates for terminal operations\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=26\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"node --test\",\n    \"check\": \"node tools/codegen.mjs --verify && node --import ./tools/aliases.mjs --test\",\n    \"codegen\": \"node tools/codegen.mjs\"\n  }\n}", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01DHUC9ACCHnU3vKGndqZwyq", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "98316c57-d9fc-4b6b-b3cc-eb670d25767f", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:45:28.216Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "# harbor-dispatch\n\nBerth planning, cargo manifests and arrival estimates for the terminal operations team.\n\nThe code is TypeScript and runs directly on Node 26; there is no build step and there are no\nruntime dependencies. Port and vessel reference data live under `registry/`. Incidents are\ntracked in the ops queue.\n---OPS---\nincidents.pack\n---PKG---\n{\n  \"name\": \"harbor-dispatch\",\n  \"version\": \"3.4.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"description\": \"Berth planning, cargo manifests and arrival estimates for terminal operations\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=26\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"node --test\",\n    \"check\": \"node tools/codegen.mjs --verify && node --import ./tools/aliases.mjs --test\",\n    \"codegen\":